        "simpleExplanation": "Imagine a modern automobile factory: instead of building each car by hand and hoping the brakes work after delivery, an automated assembly line inspects every component at every station. Database Monitoring is that automated quality check and transmission system for software. It guarantees that every change is validated, packaged immutably, and verified before customer traffic touches it.",
